WEBVTT

NOTE
'Dead End' — the escape from Dollet, pursued by the X-ATM092 spider-mech.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 12 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:05.200
Dollet's cobblestone street at dusk; the spider-mech X-ATM092 appears down the street.

00:12.000 --> 00:17.650
The X-ATM092, a massive mechanical spider with red lights, advances through the town.

00:26.000 --> 00:31.650
Close-up of the mech's legs and X-marked body as it stomps through dust.

00:39.000 --> 00:45.090
Squall runs in the foreground as the X-ATM092's glowing red core looms behind him.

00:52.000 --> 00:57.200
The mech's torso is riddled with bullet marks as it takes fire.

01:02.000 --> 01:06.350
A fiery explosion erupts at the shoreline by the seawall.

01:10.000 --> 01:11.740
The boat speeds away across the sea.
